WATCH OUT

  - Never run a command other than the one written: an unfinished
    feature is refused with a message, never approximated
    (arch/principles.md).
  - No setjmp or longjmp, no recursion on input without a depth limit,
    every allocation checked; make sanitize must pass.
  - Every code change bumps VERSION in the same commit.
  - fish and busybox are GPL v2 only: ideas only, never code
    (UPSTREAM.md).
